# Agent sync status

Desktop and `C:\dev\international-analysis` are the same Junction. Cursor and ANTIGRAVITY share one repo; divergence usually comes from stale chat context, uncommitted files, or missing `git fetch`.

## When the user asks to sync / check sync

Triggers include: `동기화`, `동기화해줘`, `동기화된 내용 확인해봐`, `싱크 맞춰줘`, `최신 tip`.

Run **status-check only** (`AGENT_SYNC.md` §A). Do **not** implement features, rewrite docs wholesale, or commit unless asked.

1. `git fetch origin` (and `git fetch desktop-local` if that remote exists)
2. Compare `HEAD` vs `origin/<branch>` (and `desktop-local/<branch>` if present)
3. Read Active Work Board top + newest handoff in `AGENT_SYNC.md`
4. List dirty/untracked paths only — do not auto-commit

Report briefly: tip · remote match · new commits · board deltas · dirty or clean.

**Source of truth = git tip**, not prior chat summaries.

## Trio-Sync

Only if the user explicitly asks for Trio / Notion / MD+GitHub+Notion (`AGENT_SYNC.md` §B).

